<title>
Excessive Pedal Travel Inspection
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
The brake pedal to carpet clearance must be measured between the specified points that vary with steering wheel position and transaxle type. Select the appropriate measuring point (1) according to the figure below.
</ptxt>
<figure>
