<s1>
<ptxt>
Start engine.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Depress brake pedal a few times.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
With brake pedal depressed with force of about 300 N (30.6 kgf, 67.4 lbf), measure clearance “a” between brake pedal and carpet. If clearance “a” is less than specification, check the following points.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Air in brake system. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A4106004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Brake fluid leakage
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Length of brake booster push rod. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A4106024"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
